direction: down

operator: Lars (SystemNix maintainer) {shape: person}

systemnix: SystemNix consumer host (out of this repo's scope, wrapper layer) {
  sops: sops-nix secrets + templates (relay password, DMARC IMAP password)
  caddy: Caddy reverse proxy (protected vhost + TLS)
  gatus: Gatus health checks (SMTP/IMAP/HTTP probes)
  alerting: systemd onFailure -> Discord webhook
  backup: backup-coordination (restic over /var/lib/stalwart + reports)
  ports: ports.nix (firewall ownership)
  stalwart: nix-email flake input -> services.mail-server + services.dmarc-monitor
}

stalwart: Stalwart 0.15.5 {
  listeners: 25 / 587 / 465 / 993 (public) + 8080 (loopback)
  store: RocksDB mail store {shape: cylinder}
  acme: ACME (dns-01 wildcard) + manual cert fallback
  relay_route: queue.strategy.route -> smarthost
}

resend: smtp.resend.com (authenticated smarthost) {shape: cloud}
dns_provider: DNS zone (MX, SPF, DKIM, DMARC, TLS-RPT, _dmarc rua) {shape: cloud}
prometheus: Prometheus + Gatus scrape targets {shape: person}
discord: Discord ops channel {shape: cloud}
restic: Encrypted offsite backup target {shape: cylinder}
users: Mail clients (IMAPS/JMAP/submission) {shape: person}
internet: Internet senders/verifiers {shape: cloud}

operator -> systemnix: declares intent in Nix
systemnix.sops -> systemnix.stalwart: templates render secrets to LoadCredential
systemnix.ports -> systemnix.stalwart: firewall ports stay owned by the wrapper
systemnix.stalwart -> stalwart: configures (wrapper defaults + overrides)
internet -> stalwart.listeners: inbound MX + DMARC rua reports
users -> stalwart.listeners: submission + IMAPS/JMAP
stalwart.listeners -> systemnix.caddy: JMAP/webadmin via reverse proxy
systemnix.caddy -> prometheus: /metrics/prometheus scrape route
stalwart.relay_route -> resend: non-local delivery (reputation offload)
stalwart.acme -> dns_provider: dns-01 challenges, zone records
dns_provider -> stalwart.listeners: resolves this host's own records
systemnix.gatus -> stalwart.listeners: probes; on failure
systemnix.alerting -> discord: page on onFailure
systemnix.backup -> restic: nightly store + report-sink snapshots
